{
 "batchId": "b-0159",
 "sourceSetHash": "2bb765198fa14f1818bc2d39e1c2b0b4fbcca43e35fd776b7cdd9a4bea65a84f",
 "locale": "zh-Hans",
 "units": [
  {
   "id": "t_6867273c7e083cfba345",
   "sourceHash": "6867273c7e083cfba345bb912e5ef92c5e6cb9afb047c5a6c9fea72d46d8a72b",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]◆[[CLOSE_1]]通过实现身心因素之间的平衡，改善整体健康状况。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_791ed2da1d3a95aa5cff",
   "sourceHash": "791ed2da1d3a95aa5cff31b377ad03696c549dc76809df6c762c1dd3e49b0179",
   "text": "阿育吠陀医生会定期与您复查，以监测进展并调整方案。我们将为您实施个性化疗法，包括按摩和草药治疗，并提供关于平衡生活、饮食和压力管理的指导。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_66960ebce55875c1e78f",
   "sourceHash": "66960ebce55875c1e78f8244a8bfc77126f16546b4f4e87985a569c45b01425b",
   "text": "阿育吠陀医生的随访问诊将为您提供指导。您将把饮食和生活方式建议等治疗后的做法融入日常生活。我们持续提供支持，解答您的任何疑虑或需求。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_97c35f39a9b44e021c58",
   "sourceHash": "97c35f39a9b44e021c58bb5dcbd73bf8358b8f78a7cc3acb197a28a6ab7e83b3",
   "text": "您的整体减压住院方案",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "'Retreat' rendered as '住院方案' (in-patient programme) to keep the clinical register and avoid resort connotations."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b07bc1641c900fe5c7ce",
   "sourceHash": "b07bc1641c900fe5c7ce72770ba7be939b19d234dd1ecb1bdd1ad23bc316d586",
   "text": "Kairali 的减压治疗对我来说是一份恩赐。来的时候我身心紧绷、精神疲惫，但舒缓的疗法、按摩和草药油让我彻底放松下来。每一次治疗都让我的压力逐渐消散，到疗程结束时，我感受到一种深深的平静与平衡。Kairali 真正懂得如何滋养心灵。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3d47872f24b4a747832a",
   "sourceHash": "3d47872f24b4a747832a98b9e13698aa510d5b1de1020cd0b9817a77c84a4452",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Jha 先生和夫人[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]★★★★★[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]5.0[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_51d74d875b776fd5dd67",
   "sourceHash": "51d74d875b776fd5dd671a0e62975236a41cd519a2107f7e6e7fe8ca8a03ee6f",
   "text": "Kairali 的压力与紧张治疗项目彻底改变了我。多年来我一直承受着巨大的压力，终于在这里得到了缓解。阿育吠陀疗法、正念练习和宁静的环境让我感受到了多年未有的平静。我带着全新的视角和深度的放松回家。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4528a48067193942f600",
   "sourceHash": "4528a48067193942f60080939d394a36c3a58fb57a376efe61207446331e1e2a",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Parul 女士[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]★★★★★[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]5.0[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cbfcedc5905e7d17adfb",
   "sourceHash": "cbfcedc5905e7d17adfb3094b563d31a1972d7f32f5b7e5212ae2f9465cac9f2",
   "text": "我从没想过自己能如此放松！Kairali 的减压方法是整体性的，也非常个性化。团队细致地引导我完成各项治疗，缓解了身体的紧张，也让头脑变得清晰。离开时，我掌握了一些方法，也获得了内心的平静，这将帮助我长期管理压力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9578cc69e7e9ee99e591",
   "sourceHash": "9578cc69e7e9ee99e591d86b9876e8de65ce4b41db1c7dd39b453eaa87defdaf",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Ritu 女士[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]★★★★★[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]5.0[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_4caf6071115c02fc462b",
   "sourceHash": "4caf6071115c02fc462b9d76b9a22f91702b4a7e1ec5d44eaf867e1e15a973b3",
   "text": "如果我正在接受心理健康治疗，是否适合参加？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_df4ac16fe7c36ce6f35a",
   "sourceHash": "df4ac16fe7c36ce6f35af972a357a308ae5e3e9b6edddb61506c0dc77bf4a6e2",
   "text": "请将您正在考虑的住院安排告知您的主治医生，并与阿育吠陀医生分享相关治疗信息。请讨论该方案的范围，以及它是否符合您所需的支持程度。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2a7389697bb64a43b46a",
   "sourceHash": "2a7389697bb64a43b46a89c8b744e8b90c3923bfbabe4302b6c9a3381fcfba7b",
   "text": "阿育吠陀减压与心理健康方案",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_e15ef03140978c35b287",
   "sourceHash": "e15ef03140978c35b28768263386a7b55b0a21c3fb2e5cc05733ee1ed4ba5600",
   "text": "Kairali 理疗师在治疗室内为一位就座的患者的头发抹上厚厚的草药膏，侧面视角，患者双眼闭合",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned word 'guest' rendered as '患者' (patient)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6e49ca386514b545a873",
   "sourceHash": "6e49ca386514b545a8737fa8cf05425681c25c0db0f4cadaa39f2224ff467c6f",
   "text": "一位就座患者双眼闭合的侧面特写，理疗师的双手将草药膏敷在她的头发上",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_accdef7a71915a7c06ed",
   "sourceHash": "accdef7a71915a7c06edb112e8edf3aaa698fd4d5917f2aa7d4d358ece04121e",
   "text": "患者坐在 Kairali 治疗室内，头发上敷着草药膏，双眼闭合，身后是一扇拱形窗户",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_3ec10ce909ac00fe463d",
   "sourceHash": "3ec10ce909ac00fe463da5910a0166368dd760aabd5d0f3062e28e520da7d754",
   "text": "缓解压力与紧张的阿育吠陀治疗项目的益处",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6ec79ccef1501caa5a7d",
   "sourceHash": "6ec79ccef1501caa5a7db3459830a2d361be29301db668cd87857ad8c8c27d9f",
   "text": "：与阿育吠陀医生进行初诊，评估您独特的体质、失衡情况以及与压力相关的具体症状。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  }
 ]
}
